{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-golf-greens","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"golf-greens","about":"Welcome to the pinnacle of luxurious living at Golf Greens in Dubai’s prestigious Damac Hills. Prepare to be captivated by Damac Properties’ extraordinary residential Twin Tower masterpiece. The luxury 1- and 2-bedroom apartments and 2 &amp; 3 bedroom townhouses are designed to redefine class and sophistication. Towers A and B are 20-story architectural masterpieces adorned with verdant plant life, creating a breathtaking, serene atmosphere. Enter a world of luxury where every inch has been meticulously crafted with a keen eye for detail. Each tower’s spacious residences come with elegance, showcasing thoughtfully designed floor plans and the finest craftsmanship throughout. Smart technology is seamlessly incorporated into each room, kitchen and bathroom, resulting in a luxurious lifestyle. The luxurious fixtures, fittings, and furnishings provide the esteemed residents with a sanctuary of comfort and indulgence.Strategically situated in an outstanding location, Golf Greens provides unrivalled convenience with various exceptional amenities and services at your fingertips. Enjoy the immaculate courses of the renowned Trump International Golf Course, or browse the numerous offerings of Damac Mall. Enjoy the peaceful environment of Fishing Lake while fulfilling your shopping requirements at the nearby supermarket. Indulge your taste palettes at our world-class dining establishments or explore the community’s vibrant retail establishments. As a resident, you will have access to abundant integrated facilities, such as pools, cafes, lush gardens, and top-tier security services, ensuring a luxurious and safe living environment. Large parking spaces provide the uttermost convenience, completing Golf Greens’ unmatched collection of amenities. At Golf Greens, every moment is imbued w